WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.312
Let’s walk through Review History.

00:00:02.312 --> 00:00:05.350
Use history as an immutable explanation of what White Cell

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.537
decided, when, and why.

00:00:07.537 --> 00:00:11.113
Compare revisions and return notes without reopening a closed record

00:00:11.113 --> 00:00:12.912
through informal edits.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:16.575
On this slide, inspect completed, returned, rejected

00:00:16.575 --> 00:00:19.562
, and superseded review records across queues.

00:00:19.562 --> 00:00:22.400
In practice, use history to audit what White Cell

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.938
decided and why;

00:00:23.938 --> 00:00:26.950
do not reopen a closed decision by editing the historical

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:27.712
row.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:31.085
When you are ready, use Open Review History to

00:00:31.085 --> 00:00:32.885
move to the live surface.

00:00:32.885 --> 00:00:35.585
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:35.585 --> 00:00:35.735
.
